Provenance of `confidence_types.py`
====================================

`confidence_types.py` in this directory is a modified copy of:

    src/alphafold3/model/confidence_types.py

from the AlphaFold 3 repository
(https://github.com/google-deepmind/alphafold3),
copyright Google DeepMind, distributed under CC-BY-NC-SA 4.0.

Modification
------------

The `to_json` / `convert` path in `StructureConfidenceSummary` has been
changed to round confidence scores (ipTM, pTM, chain_pair_iptm, etc.) to
**7 decimal places** in the emitted JSON, instead of the lower default
precision in the upstream file. This higher precision is useful for
ensemble-ranking analyses where small confidence differences matter.

No other behavioural changes have been made.

